abstract: >-
  Start Skill turns scattered AI chats, sessions, and side projects into one
  tracked portfolio with a governed folder per project, a persistent engineering
  brain, model-attributed suggestions, professional reporting, and Claude-facing
  CLI and MCP interfaces. It is intended for traceable, high-fidelity,
  multi-project engineering workflows.
keywords:
  - agentic engineering
  - portfolio orchestration
  - project governance
  - AI agents
  - traceability
  - high-fidelity systems
